title: 엔딩70_양나현_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
(Time passed, and...)
(During our third date, I finally confessed to NaHyun.)
{name()}: NaHyun, I really like you.
{name()}: Will you be my girlfriend?
<<show hyun_blush>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: {name()}... I like you too.
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: Yes, I'd love to.
(NaHyun smiled shyly and took my hand.)
(And just like that, we...)
(Became the school's most notorious "lovey-dovey" couple.)
Classmate: Ugh, those two are glued together on the folding bed again. Let's get out of here.
(The club room basically became our honeymoon home.)
(I felt a bit bad for the other club members, but nothing could stop our love.)
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: {name()}, you were actually awake back then, weren't you?
(Of course, our relationship wasn't always smooth sailing.)
{name()}: Hey, why are you even digging through my game logs?
NaHyun: Is that what's important right now? You lied to me and played games behind my back.
{name()}: ......
{name()}: I'm sorry. I just wanted to give you a surprise gift,
{name()}: So I spent the whole night farming in 'WapleStory'......
NaHyun: ......
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play 양나현_허>>
NaHyun: Hmph.
NaHyun: Just words?
{name()}: Oh, come on.
(I gave NaHyun a kiss and acted cute to melt her heart.)
(We fought often, but each fight only made us closer.)
(And as more time slipped by...)
NaHyun: Hey, {name()}.
NaHyun: Are you going to marry me?
{name()}: *Pfft!*
(I accidentally spat out the water I was drinking.)
<<show hyun_spec>>
NaHyun: ...
{name()}: Of course. Want to go get married right now, since you brought it up?
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: ... Really?
{name()}: I never go back on my word. That's my motto.
NaHyun: I'd like that...
(And those words, spoken so casually,)
(Actually. Came. True.)
<<play 공통_웅성>>
Officiant:  Bride and Groom, please enter!
<<play 공통_축하>>
Friends: WHOOOO!!!!
(A storm of applause follows.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: Let's go.
<<hide>>
<<bg 양나현_진엔딩>>
(As I walked down the aisle with NaHyun,)
(I received more congratulations than I ever had in my entire life.)
(With my wrist tightly bound by the red thread of fate she held.)
(From now on, I belong to her forever.)
(And she, too, will be my woman for the rest of our lives.)
(Visualizing a happy future together.)
<<bg 양나현_진엔딩2>>
<<wait 1>>
NaHyun: Let's be happy together forever, okay~?
<<wait 1>>
<<bg 양나현_진엔딩>>
<<wait 1>>
<<end>>
===